Online Education WebsiteThis project is an online education platform designed to make learning accessible and flexible for both students and educators. The platform allows teachers to upload, manage, and organize video-based courses, while students can engage by liking and commenting on the content.🔗 View LiveClick Here to View Live(Note: We will be uploading the live version soon)🚀 Features🎓 For TeachersRegistration & Login: Secure access for educators to manage their profile.Video Management: Easily upload, edit, and delete course videos.Course Creation: Organize multiple videos into cohesive learning modules.📖 For StudentsRegistration & Login: Students must register to track progress and access courses.Course Engagement: Like videos and leave comments to interact with instructors.Comment Management: Full control to edit or delete personal comments.📱 General FeaturesResponsive Design: Optimized for desktops, tablets, and mobile phones.User-Friendly Interface: Clean and simple navigation for a smooth learning experience.🛠 Technology StackComponentTechnologyFrontendHTML5, CSS3, JavaScriptBackendPHP (Server-side scripting)DatabaseMySQLToolsXAMPP / WAMP⚙️ Setup Instructions1. Clone the RepositoryBashgit clone https://github.com/Sakshid9/OnlineEducationWebsite.git
2. Install DependenciesYou will need XAMPP or WAMP to run the local PHP server and MySQL database.
